Mangekyo @VERSION@ for macOS
================================

Package: @ARCH_LABEL@ (@ARCH@)
Minimum system: macOS 12 Monterey
Backend: Metal

Installation
------------

Drag Mangekyo.app onto the Applications alias in this disk image. Eject the
disk image, then open Mangekyo from Applications.

This package contains the native SwiftUI app, the matching gpu_benchmark
worker, and the Metal shaders needed by that worker. Benchmark results,
captures, reports, and logs are stored under:

  ~/Library/Application Support/GpuComputeBenchmark/

Architecture and validation
---------------------------

@VALIDATION@

The package is a single-architecture build. Use the Apple Silicon package on
M-series Macs and the Intel package on Intel Macs.

Release-signing note
--------------------

The default local build uses an ad-hoc signature and is not notarized. A public
Internet release should instead set MACOS_SIGN_IDENTITY to a Developer ID
Application certificate, notarize the result, and staple the ticket.

License
-------

See LICENSE.txt and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in this disk image. Additional
third-party license files are included inside Mangekyo.app.
